{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09906","headline":"送史司马赴崔相公幕 · 岑参","name":"送史司马赴崔相公幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峥嵘丞相府，清切凤皇池。\n羡尔瑶台鹤，高栖琼树枝。\n归飞晴日好，吟弄惠风吹。\n正有乘轩乐，初当学舞时。\n珍禽在罗网，微命若游丝。\n愿托周南羽，相衔谿水湄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09906.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09906","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}